WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.840
- Do you think, cuz I feel

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.360
like you do get political in a good way.

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.220
Do you feel like you'd
ever get into politics?

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:06.370
Would you ever do that?

00:00:09.182 --> 00:00:13.650
- If I can figure out
a way to run for office

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:17.250
and still maintain my integrity

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.913
which I'm not sure is
something that you can do.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.970
- That's the saddest statement.

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:24.990
It's so true.
- I know, I know.

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.120
I think that our politicians get into it

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.710
for the right reasons,

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:33.123
and on both sides get very
caught up in the power of it.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.880
- Also how to get out there.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:36.810
Like to have support.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.310
- It's such a bureaucracy.

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:40.560
And they're constantly fundraising

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.210
and they go where the money goes

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:45.840
and it's just very easy to get caught up

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.610
in all of that.
- That pattern.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.600
- I'm an activist.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.250
I'm happy to be an activist

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.380
and I feel like I get a lot done.

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:56.220
If at some point I could figure
out how to get as much done

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:58.350
and run for office.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.960
I'm not saying no.
- Against the idea.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.820
- And also my kids are little.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.410
And you have to be in D.C. so much.

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.153
So maybe as they get older.

